    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Blog ideas** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Fill the input columns (topic). Leave title_options, outline empty: the AI fills it.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and how many rows to process per run.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n5. Run once by hand, check the results, then switch to **Active**. It only touches rows where title_options is empty.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
